Get him, get him!

266
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:26,960
That's his plan?

267
00:17:27,140 --> 00:17:30,905
Does he realize what's gonna
happen when we run into that fence?

268
00:17:39,940 --> 00:17:40,770
IMPOSSIBLE!

269
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,560
That seat train!

270
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:44,920
It's flying!

271
00:17:46,720 --> 00:17:47,550
No, no!

272
00:17:47,633 --> 00:17:48,700
We're gonna die!

273
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:50,050
What?

274
00:17:50,133 --> 00:17:51,420
But I don't wanna die!

275
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:54,620
Leave me this way! I'll save you!

276
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:55,590
Fall into my arms!

277
00:17:55,673 --> 00:17:56,597
Shut up, you idiot!

278
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,739
I've got enough problems right now!

279
00:18:03,440 --> 00:18:08,205
Zoro, you better have felt long and hard
about how you're going to land this egg!

280
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:10,520
Of course I have.

281
00:18:19,020 --> 00:18:20,960
We fall. Get out!

282
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,240
I hate you!

283
00:18:23,420 --> 00:18:26,340
We'll find out if luck's
on our side soon enough!

284
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:30,050
Ah!

285
00:18:30,133 --> 00:18:31,420
Oimo's going down!

286
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:52,417
Whoa! What a crew! Are you...

287
00:18:52,500 --> 00:18:54,140
Straw Hats? Damn strange!

288
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,120
Is that so?

289
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:59,420
That doesn't matter. Let's
move. Time's a-wasting.

290
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:02,380
We gotta clear a path and fast. All right!

291
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:03,796
You heard him, guys!

292
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:05,155
We need to go deeper!

293
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:07,120
Let's make a hole! Yeah!

294
00:19:19,380 --> 00:19:20,210
Paulie, no!

295
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:25,517
Who in the hell are you?

296
00:19:25,600 --> 00:19:26,657
Who us?

297
00:19:26,740 --> 00:19:32,177
I'll tell you the first class guards
of Enies Lobby the watchdogs of the law

298
00:19:32,260 --> 00:19:39,140
by order of chief justice baskerville for
your crimes you're sentenced to death!

299
00:19:40,100 --> 00:19:45,897
Damn they just keep coming one after
another oymote what are you doing?

300
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:48,697
How could you let Let this
pirate riff-raff open the gate!

301
00:19:48,780 --> 00:19:50,074
What's wrong with you?

302
00:19:54,420 --> 00:19:56,080
Can't believe I pissed you!

303
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:58,780
Oh crap!

304
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:01,296
That giant's back up and on his feet!

305
00:20:04,620 --> 00:20:07,900
Little jerks, you're dead! You're back!

306
00:20:33,600 --> 00:20:35,337
Whoa! Whoa! What the...

307
00:20:35,420 --> 00:20:37,960
Rocket Man fell from the sky!

308
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,575
Will you open those gates for nothing?

309
00:20:49,020 --> 00:20:49,850
Ha!

310
00:20:50,140 --> 00:20:51,787
What the hell just happened?

311
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:53,980
Man, that was some landing.

312
00:20:54,380 --> 00:20:56,204
Do you think that they're okay?

313
00:21:01,900 --> 00:21:04,060
They're not coming out.

314
00:21:08,540 --> 00:21:09,620
They in there?

315
00:21:19,880 --> 00:21:21,292
Hey, you guys all right?

316
00:21:25,300 --> 00:21:26,800
What? Impossible!

317
00:21:27,140 --> 00:21:28,199
Who are those two?

318
00:21:36,320 --> 00:21:37,150
Huh.

319
00:21:37,233 --> 00:21:39,697
Maybe we should have
introduced ourselves first.

320
00:21:39,780 --> 00:21:42,309
Nah, I'd rather let my
feet do the talking.

321
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:44,000
The Straw Hats are here!

322
00:21:44,420 --> 00:21:46,008
We've been waiting for you!

323
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:48,160
Yeah! Hehehe!

324
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:52,750
Excellent!

325
00:21:52,833 --> 00:21:55,220
Just like I planned it! Wow! Really?

326
00:22:30,340 --> 00:22:33,140
Thank you.

327
00:22:50,800 --> 00:22:53,517
See you

328
00:22:53,600 --> 00:23:00,040
next time.
